---
description: >-
  Nesting order between rect background blocks and loop blocks in both
  directions: a rect wrapping a loop, and separately a loop containing a
  rect.
---
sequenceDiagram
  A ->> B: 1
  rect rgb(204, 0, 102)
  loop check C
    C ->> C: Every 10 seconds
  end
  end
  A ->> B: 2
  loop check D
  C ->> D: 3
  rect rgb(153, 153, 255)
  D -->> D: 5
  D --> C: 4
  end
  end
